<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29070" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">millĭes</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mīlĭes</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">milliens</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mi-liens</span></b> ),
			adv.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				thousand times</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quinquies millies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 23, 21, § 85</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semel et tricies millies mille,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1,
					6</span></i>
			.—<i>Innumerable times</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">moreretur prius millies quam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rab. Perd. 5, 15</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Sest. 58, 123</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Att. 7,
				11, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genera juris millies mutata sunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rep. 3, 10, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">millies melius,</span>”
				<i>a thousand times better</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Phil. 2, 44, 112</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plus miliens audivi,</span>”
				<i>more than a thousand times</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Eun. 3, 1, 32</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
